### Netcup SCP API — Networking
# rDNS management (by IP), VLANs, and failover IPs.

### Get rDNS for IPv4
GET {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv4/REPLACE_WITH_IPV4_ADDRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Set rDNS for IPv4
POST {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv4
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ip": "REPLACE_WITH_IPV4_ADDRESS",
  "rdns": "ptr.example.com"
}

### Delete rDNS for IPv4
DELETE {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv4/REPLACE_WITH_IPV4_ADDRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get rDNS for IPv6
GET {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv6/REPLACE_WITH_IPV6_ADDRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Set rDNS for IPv6
POST {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv6
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ip": "REPLACE_WITH_IPV6_ADDRESS",
  "rdns": "ptr.example.com"
}

### Delete rDNS for IPv6
DELETE {{base_url}}/rdns/ipv6/REPLACE_WITH_IPV6_ADDRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List VLANs
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/vlans
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single VLAN
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/vlans/REPLACE_WITH_VLAN_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update VLAN Name (server must be SHUTOFF)
PUT {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/vlans/REPLACE_WITH_VLAN_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-vlan"
}

### List IPv4 Failover IPs
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/failoverips/v4
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Filter IPv4 Failover IPs by Server
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/failoverips/v4?serverId={{server_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Route IPv4 Failover IP to Server
PATCH {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/failoverips/v4/REPLACE_WITH_FAILOVER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "serverId": 0
}

### List IPv6 Failover IPs
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/failoverips/v6
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Route IPv6 Failover IP to Server
PATCH {{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/failoverips/v6/REPLACE_WITH_FAILOVER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "serverId": 0
}
